{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a synergistic limited pool of<strong> dice</strong>\u00a0in this\u00a0<strong>deck-building, turn-based roguelike</strong> game where you fight to reclaim your swamp from the corruption that has overtaken it. Each die comes with six sides containing their own actions and abilities that pair together, along with powerful relics acquired during a run, in order to dish out some devastating attacks and combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/4c6ef8b02f39d26578b344b24c067981.poster.avif?t=1767911181\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/4c6ef8b02f39d26578b344b24c067981.webm?t=1767911181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/4c6ef8b02f39d26578b344b24c067981.mp4?t=1767911181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your  pool from a growing set of dice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize which dice stay, and which ones go as you only have 10 slots available to you at once. Each die over unique ways to win in battle. Some may seem weak, but paired with the right dice or relics, all can find a way to be useful during your run making sure each one is unique and fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/f857cc74c906eb448d32687635a71dfe.poster.avif?t=1767911181\" width=1078 height=792 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/f857cc74c906eb448d32687635a71dfe.webm?t=1767911181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/f857cc74c906eb448d32687635a71dfe.mp4?t=1767911181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your dice to your needs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a die just isn't feeling strong enough forge it to upgrade different sides or even swap sides on two dice in order to create the perfect one to suit your current needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/f19228526b10567d76019a19af5058af.webp?t=1767911181\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/f19228526b10567d76019a19af5058af.poster.avif?t=1767911181\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=549 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the swamp</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all that your homeland has in store for you, from dangerous traps to calm fishing holes and everything else in between. Maybe the inhabitants that aren't trying to thwart you can actually help you on your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/f64fa6c57ab430c4408dc987a2b6431e.poster.avif?t=1767911181\" width=1170 height=702 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/f64fa6c57ab430c4408dc987a2b6431e.webm?t=1767911181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/f64fa6c57ab430c4408dc987a2b6431e.mp4?t=1767911181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If all else fails, just hope luck is on your side</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947390?t=1767911181","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947390?t=1767911181","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/1ece26e9503f6656cc4d4e8ac7016b3fb927f042/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767911181","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/1ece26e9503f6656cc4d4e8ac7016b3fb927f042/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767911181","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Save Your Spot for the Beta</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/5dd9138c182e626c058059e40a0e5b7e.avif?t=1767911181\" width=1560 height=406 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a synergistic limited pool of<strong> dice</strong>\u00a0in this\u00a0<strong>deck-building, turn-based roguelike</strong> game where you fight to reclaim your swamp from the corruption that has overtaken it. Each die comes with six sides containing their own actions and abilities that pair together, along with powerful relics acquired during a run, in order to dish out some devastating attacks and 